4.3.RSR++
Having presented RSR, we now present our faster algorithm
RSR++ that focuses on improving Step 2 of RSR. This step
involves computing the product of a vector ⃗ uof size 2kand
the binary matrix Bin [k]of size 2k×k(Line 2 of Algorithm
2). The standard vector-matrix multiplication, in this case,
leads to O(k·2k)time. However, the special structure of
