kblocks. This approach takes advantage of the low-level
optimizations already integrated into PyTorch. However,
the baseline we compare against benefits from additional
PyTorch-specific optimizations beyond this implementation.
The forward() function in the baseline model
(BitLinear ) uses a single vector-matrix multiplication in
PyTorch:
